            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Needle 0.8.0</h2><ul><li>The Listening Room adds focused audition controls and an evidence inspector.</li><li>Persistent bookmarks keep recordings available for later review.</li><li>Updated yt-dlp and fixed Swift concurrency and test framework lookup issues.</li></ul><p>This release is unsigned and not notarized.</p>]]></description>
