            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Needle 0.5.0</h2><ul><li>Library discovers existing recordings in your Needle folder, including CLI downloads.</li><li>Refresh after adding files outside the app, with no duplicate entries.</li><li>Read embedded tags and artwork while preserving existing files and Spotify status.</li></ul><p>This release is unsigned and not notarized. macOS may require Privacy &amp; Security → Open Anyway.</p>]]></description>
